sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant CC as CommentController
    participant CS as CommentService
    participant PC as PostClient
    participant CR as CommentRepository
    participant DB as MySQL (comment_db)
    participant RMQ as RabbitMQ

    Note over FE,RMQ: Create Comment Flow
    FE->>GW: POST /api/comments/ + Bearer Token
    GW->>GW: Validate JWT
    GW->>CC: Forward with X-Headers
    CC->>CS: create(request, principal)
    CS->>PC: getMeta(postId)
    PC-->>CS: PostMetaResponse (authorId, title)
    CS->>CS: HtmlSanitizer.sanitize(content)
    CS->>CR: save(comment)
    CR->>DB: INSERT INTO comments
    DB-->>CR: saved

    alt Is reply (parentCommentId != null)
        CS->>RMQ: send("comment.reply", payload)
    else Is top-level comment
        CS->>RMQ: send("comment.new", payload)
    end

    CS-->>CC: CommentResponse
    CC-->>GW: 201 Created
    GW-->>FE: Response

    Note over FE,RMQ: Like Comment Flow
    FE->>GW: POST /api/comments/{id}/like
    GW->>CC: Forward
    CC->>CS: like(commentId, principal)
    CS->>CR: findById(commentId)
    alt Already liked
        CS->>DB: DELETE FROM comment_likes
        CS->>CR: decrement likesCount
    else Not yet liked
        CS->>DB: INSERT INTO comment_likes
        CS->>CR: increment likesCount
    end
    CS-->>CC: LikeResponse
    CC-->>GW: 200 OK
    GW-->>FE: Response
